            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That is mostly by design. Main problem here is the formatting afterwards: I don't think there is a universal, filetype-agnostic rule to do this. The closest one seems to be \"indent all lines by a single tab or tab worth of spaces\", but it is still not universal (and not so easy to implement at the moment).\r\n\r\nI'll have this in mind.",
